.TH TIMER_TICK 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
timer_tick \- Advance a timer by dt
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqtween.h\(dq
.BI "bool timer_tick(Timer *t, float dt);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Advance a timer by dt. Returns true on the single tick it reaches zero, then stops; returns false while counting and while stopped. The usual shape: if (timer_tick(&g\->spawn, dt)) { spawn(); timer_start(&g\->spawn, 2.0f); }. For "is the effect still active" read t\->running instead.
.PP
This is a static inline function; it is defined in the header.
.SH RETURN VALUE
true once, on the tick the timer expires.
.SH MODULE
tween (src/engine/tween/tween.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR timer_start (3),
.BR Timer (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
